<title>USA: Health Care REIT names chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Health Care REIT names chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care REIT Inc said on Tuesday that  George Chapman has been named chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Health Care REIT said Chapman will continue to serve as president and director, positions he assumed in 1995 and 1994, respectively.</p>
<p>Bruce Thompson, outgoing chairman and chief executive officer, announced his retirement effective yesterday, the company said.</p>
